Let's expand the powers for $
\left(\blueD{7^2}\right)^{\greenD{4}}=\purpleD{n^8}$.

$\begin{align}
\left(\blueD{7^2}\right)^{\greenD4}&=\underbrace{\blueD{7^2\cdot 7^2 \cdot7^2 \cdot 7^2}}_\greenD{\text{{4 times}}}
\\\\\\
&=\underbrace{
\underbrace{\blueD{7\cdot 7}}_\text{2 times}
\cdot \underbrace{\blueD{7\cdot 7}}_\text{2 times}
\cdot \underbrace{\blueD{7\cdot 7}}_\text{2 times}
\cdot \underbrace{\blueD{7\cdot 7}}_\text{2 times}}
_\greenD{\text{4 times}}
\\\\
&=\purpleD{\underbrace{n\cdot n\cdot n\cdot n\cdot  n\cdot  n\cdot n \cdot n }_\text{8 times}}
\\\\
\end{align}$
